OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after
OL,4,Acity-centre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fman was seriously injured in a stabbing
OL,9,Fin Liverpool city centre, police have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FMerseyside Police said officers were
OL,13,Fcalled to Chavasse Park just after
OL,14,F21:00 GMT on Sunday. The victim was
OL,15,Ffound in a serious condition and taken
OL,16,Fto hospital.
OL,18,FDetectives believe it was an isolated
OL,19,Fincident and have appealed for any
OL,20,Fwitnesses to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
